learly there's a connection  here with the time stone and time-travel  and another connection to multiverse of  madness is simply because Shima gorath  is from another dimension now we know  that multiverse of madness is going to  open up multiple different dimensions  multiple different realities and  universes that's why it's called the  multiverse of madness so perhaps somehow  while Doctor Strange is working with the  time stone he manages to open up all of  these different realities and the threat  of shuma gorath becomes very real for  his current reality  either way this plot synopsis does  confirm the return of the time stone the  return of Baron Mordo and something very  evil is coming to dr. strange so what do  you think about this new plot synopsis  what do you think about the Infinity  stones returning let me know how you  feel about this and the comments down  below also don't forget to like the  video and subscribe when notifications  turned on so you can stay up to date on  everything we're lightening to the MCU  and so you can enter my giveaway for a  chance to win two Xbox one or ps4 the  winner is chosen at five hundred and  fifty thousand subscribers as always  thank you all so much for watching  woof woof
 

